# component: tooltip
# decisions: DOC-2, OVL-13, OVL-14
# hunks:
#   OVL-13: `TooltipContent` reads `useInternalThemeScope()` and attaches it to the Positioner
#     inside the Portal. A portaled popup leaves its theme subtree, so a nested scope
#     (`.dark`, a scoped surface) is lost by inheritance unless the host re-applies it.
#     `tooling/verify-portal-theme-scope.mjs` inventories this host.
#   OVL-14: `TooltipContent` forwards a `container` to its Portal. Upstream forwards none, and a
#     portal defaults to `document.body` — which the Fullscreen API paints the fullscreen element
#     OVER, so a fullscreen player's control tooltips render invisibly behind it. The prop is
#     optional and `undefined` is upstream's own default, so no existing caller moves.
#   cn: `import { cn } from "cn"` becomes `@vegastack/design` — our npm layer owns `cn` (DOC-2).
#   formatting: the repository formatter (prettier defaults: semicolons, trailing commas)
#               reflows the file; those hunks carry no decision of their own.
